														1. We wait for our lost leader Safron.<br />
2. We will allways behave as Knights.<br />
3. We will have fun.<br />
<br />
--------------------------------------<br />
<br />
Why wait? she may never return? <br />
<br />
&quot;Its our mission&quot;, like the Knights of the Holy Grail, we may never complete it, but the mission is an honorable one. Why choose a direction that is copied from all the other guilds, no ours is unique and special to KOTEW. Its also totally unselfish. (I still believe she will return BTW).<br />
<br />
--------------------------------------<br />
<br />
The mission can sound &quot;stale&quot; I dont want that to happen. We must listen to new ideas and develop wisely.<br />
<br />
We must remain &quot;unique&quot; from other guilds and aviod trying to emulate them.<br />
<br />
--------------------------------------						</td>
