						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Just a question, are you not emulating the knights of the round table when you state that &quot;it's our mission&quot; just like the knights of the holy grail who may never complete it.  That is emulating something.. <br />
<br />
I think that Safron should be your guild idol and there is a motto.. KOTEW &quot;to stand by our safron, to never give up!&quot; and you are the leader Fallguy.. but Safron is why the guild is here today, but she is not why you have the guild today or how the people have joined it.. it should be a mission statement that KOTEW never give up, and that KOTEW will always remmber Safron as a legend.. <br />
<br />
To me dwelling on &quot;she will return... &quot; people will say.. when? where is she.. why has she not returned.. <br />
<br />
put it up front.. Safron is lost.. we have hope she will return, but until then she is our legend, our hero, our existance.. Safron is KOTEW, and we stand by her, and never give up&quot;<br />
<br />
im rambling but just putting in some ideas..						</td>
